  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN WPS Training Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports ASEAN-IPR in the delivery of their WPS training programme for government officials from ASEAN Member States (AMS). The training aims to help officials learn more about WPS and then reflect this learning in policy making, to ultimately support more women&#x2019;s participation, protection and rehabilitation in conflict resolution and peacebuilding.</narrative>
  </description>
